 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "logs are unordered [timestamp, userId, resource] string triples; timestamps are decimal integer strings, distinct per user. For each user, sort their entries by numeric timestamp to get a path r1..rN and count the transitions START->r1, r_i->r_{i+1} and rN->END. Counts accumulate across users. Return [from, to, count] rows sorted by from then to in plain string (code-point) order (inferred output shape).",
